# Cline's workspace ignore file (patterns as in .gitignore). Files that match are
# hidden from the agent's file listing, reading and search tools.
#
# CGGA is the held-out external cohort. Nothing reads it outside a script that
# has first called gliostrata.evaluation.read_guard.record_access. Workspace-wide
# tools do not know that rule: on 2026-11-27T05:48:55Z a repository-wide text
# search opened the five extracted text files under data/raw/cgga/_cache/extracted/
# (access ledger entries 8 and 9). .gitignore alone did not stop it.
#
# Keep these two lines in step with .rgignore.
data/raw/cgga/
data/processed/cgga/
